# Store every file's bytes verbatim.
#
# EXPORT_MANIFEST.sha256 is computed over the working tree. If git converted
# line endings on commit (core.autocrlf), the bytes this repository serves
# would not be the bytes the manifest attests, and `sha256sum -c` would fail
# on every text file. It has done exactly that before.
#
# Text files in this export are LF. The frozen snapshot under usdc_depeg/data/
# keeps its original bytes, because usdc_depeg/data/MANIFEST.json pins a
# SHA-256 over each of them.
* -text
